  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 508.08 Duration of Decision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 508.08 Duration of Decision. Final decisions under this part shall be valid for 5 years. If a project is not initiated within that time period, a new environmental review shall be undertaken.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
